-- MAYENFA3SH TEDDILO QEEMA ------------------------------ main.franco.kl  K0710

El naw7eya el shmal men `=` lazem tekoon makan: variable, w momken ba3do `.field` aw `[index]`, w aslo met3arraf b `motghayer`. Da qeema met7asba, fa mafeesh makan net7afaz feeh el natiga.

9│     total(xs) = 3
       ^^^^^^^^^

Mosa3da: Erbot el qeema b esm gedeed b `khali` badal keda, aw eddi el qeema lel variable elly gat menno.

